# The working tree is LF, and stays LF on every platform.
#
# Git on Windows defaults to converting on checkout, which would rewrite every file in the
# repository the first time it is cloned and put `stylua --check` and the analyzer's line numbers
# out of step with what was committed. Roblox, lune and every tool here read LF fine.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Vendored competitor sources are evidence, not this project's code. Never diffed, never blamed.
_refsrc/** linguist-vendored
bench/vendor/** linguist-vendored

# Generated: a Roblox API dump for selene, and the analyzer's type definitions.
roblox.yml linguist-generated
tools/globalTypes.d.luau linguist-generated
